                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of
                            State to Ambassador McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-01-21"><hi rendition="#italic">January 21,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. McCormick to forward translations of all decisions
                    rendered by the admiralty court.)</p>
            </div>
